<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:45,830 --> 00:01:46,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

26
00:02:00,090 --> 00:02:03,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It will be necessary for you
to die once...</font>

27
00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:08,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die once you said?</font>

28
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind Awakening Pill.</font>

29
00:02:20,990 --> 00:02:22,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will take these.</font>

30
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:26,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind Awakening Pill...?
What is that?</font>

31
00:02:27,660 --> 00:02:30,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your Curse Mark level is
at the first state...</font>

32
00:02:31,330 --> 00:02:32,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These pills will forcibly stimulate</font>

33
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:35,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the power of the Curse Marks
to the second state.</font>

34
00:02:38,340 --> 00:02:40,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, if you move up
to the second state</font>

35
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:44,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Curse Mark's erosion
will accelerate drastically</font>

36
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:47,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and if things are left that way
you will die immediately!</font>

37
00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:49,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

38
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:53,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In order to control
the power of the second state</font>

39
00:02:54,020 --> 00:02:55,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it is necessary to allow one's body
to get accustomed to it</font>

40
00:02:56,070 --> 00:02:57,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">over the course of several hours.</font>

41
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In doing so you will...</font>

42
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:08,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">attain power that is
equal to ours however...</font>

43
00:03:10,870 --> 00:03:13,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once awake you can't possibly
last more than a few minutes...</font>

44
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and will certainly die!</font>

45
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:22,640
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#000000">Contact</font></font>

46
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:22,640
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#000000">- The True Strength of the Four Sound Ninja -</font></font>

47
00:03:38,400 --> 00:03:41,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die... and what will happen after that?</font>

48
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to worry.</font>

49
00:03:45,320 --> 00:03:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why we're here.</font>

50
00:03:54,170 --> 00:03:58,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will use Barrier Ninjutsu
to suppress the side effects.</font>

51
00:03:59,010 --> 00:04:00,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will mitigate that phase</font>

52
00:04:00,420 --> 00:04:03,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to ease you from eternal death
to a state of half death.</font>

53
00:04:07,310 --> 00:04:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really think I can put my faith
in your Barrier Ninjutsu or whatever?</font>

54
00:04:12,690 --> 00:04:14,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-sama...</font>

55
00:04:15,190 --> 00:04:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We normally function
as Orochimaru-sama's bodyguards!</font>

56
00:04:19,730 --> 00:04:22,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We know our stuff when it comes
to Barrier or Defense Ninjutsu</font>

57
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Curse Marks and Sealing Jutsu!</font>

58
00:04:38,670 --> 00:04:43,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely cannot die yet!</font>

59
00:04:47,510 --> 00:04:48,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you.</font>

60
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:15,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

61
00:05:15,290 --> 00:05:18,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're gonna lose him
if you guys are slow!</font>

62
00:05:32,220 --> 00:05:33,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get into position!</font>

63
00:05:34,850 --> 00:05:35,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begin!</font>

64
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Four Black Mists Formation!
— Four Black Mists Formation!</font>

65
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:19,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Black Seal!</font>

66
00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:27,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right. We're done for now.</font>

67
00:06:36,950 --> 00:06:38,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, I'm exhausted.</font>

68
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:41,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think this mission
would drag on this long.</font>

69
00:06:49,380 --> 00:06:53,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go check out the situation.
Let's go, Raido!</font>

70
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right.</font>

71
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:05,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn. This has sure gotten troublesome.</font>

72
00:07:06,230 --> 00:07:07,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's one...</font>

73
00:07:07,990 --> 00:07:09,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, two of them.</font>

74
00:07:11,110 --> 00:07:11,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here they come!</font>

75
00:07:23,670 --> 00:07:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are Orochimaru's...</font>

76
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:28,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Judging from the direction
you came from</font>

77
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:31,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it appears that you are on your way back
from the Village Hidden in the Leaves...</font>

78
00:07:38,980 --> 00:07:40,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's in that barrel?</font>

79
00:07:41,850 --> 00:07:43,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having two Jonin as opponents...</font>

80
00:07:44,860 --> 00:07:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a tough one.</font>

81
00:08:28,230 --> 00:08:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Every one of them
got the Curse Marks...</font>

82
00:08:31,110 --> 00:08:33,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You refuse to answer?</font>

83
00:08:33,700 --> 00:08:36,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This will be different from that time before
with your surprise attack.</font>

84
00:08:37,070 --> 00:08:38,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, you scum!</font>

85
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just drop dead!</font>

86
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:43,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru's toys...</font>

87
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:47,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you dare monkey around
with Leaf Shinobi!</font>

88
00:09:06,900 --> 00:09:09,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those two are really late, aren't they?</font>

89
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:12,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do, Shizune-san?</font>

90
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go see!</font>

91
00:09:14,990 --> 00:09:15,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

92
00:09:24,370 --> 00:09:25,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru!</font>

93
00:09:26,460 --> 00:09:27,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

94
00:09:28,170 --> 00:09:31,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's a smell of blood nearby.</font>

95
00:09:45,180 --> 00:09:46,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What's this?!</font>

96
00:10:01,700 --> 00:10:03,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raido! Genma!</font>

97
00:10:14,090 --> 00:10:14,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't good!</font>

98
00:10:23,260 --> 00:10:26,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe these two
could have been taken down...!</font>

99
00:10:42,530 --> 00:10:45,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The best I can do right now is
give him some stop-gap treatment...</font>

100
00:10:46,290 --> 00:10:47,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune-san...</font>

101
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna hunt those guys down!</font>

102
00:10:51,790 --> 00:10:52,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

103
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:54,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But...</font>

104
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:57,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait... Iwashi.</font>

105
00:11:00,260 --> 00:11:04,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-The Jutsu that those guys have
is no longer that of mere Shinobi...</font>

106
00:11:06,930 --> 00:11:10,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you pursue them alone
you'll only die.</font>

107
00:11:12,230 --> 00:11:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Genma... don't talk anymore!</font>

108
00:11:25,330 --> 00:11:29,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The smell of the other two impinged
on the five others including Sasuke...</font>

109
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:33,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the five are moving away
from the smell of the blood!</font>

110
00:11:33,830 --> 00:11:34,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do?!</font>

111
00:11:35,420 --> 00:11:39,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought.
He has guides.</font>

112
00:11:39,920 --> 00:11:42,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This has really turned into
a real pain in the neck.</font>

113
00:11:42,430 --> 00:11:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hurry up and pursue Sasuke!</font>

114
00:11:45,430 --> 00:11:47,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, Naruto!</font>

115
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:51,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's for Shikamaru to decide!
Don't play the boss!</font>

116
00:11:53,020 --> 00:11:54,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru?</font>

117
00:11:55,230 --> 00:11:58,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fact that there was
the smell of blood probably means</font>

118
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that a battle occurred somewhere.</font>

119
00:12:01,030 --> 00:12:04,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we go to that location we should
be able to gather some information...</font>

120
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:09,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We must be attentive
as we near the location</font>

121
00:12:09,750 --> 00:12:11,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so we would have to switch over to</font>

122
00:12:11,540 --> 00:12:14,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a reconnaissance pattern
and approach walking slowly...</font>

123
00:12:14,460 --> 00:12:16,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While all that's going on</font>

124
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:19,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke will cross over
the Land of Fire border!</font>

125
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are we gonna do, Shikamaru?!</font>

126
00:12:28,510 --> 00:12:30,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Let's pursue Sasuke!</font>

127
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:33,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! That's what I was waiting for!</font>

128
00:12:33,770 --> 00:12:34,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...</font>

129
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:41,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The fact that there was a battle
means they'll have their guard up.</font>

130
00:12:42,530 --> 00:12:43,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They'll certainly be aware</font>

131
00:12:43,490 --> 00:12:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of the fact that there might
be Ninja on their tail.</font>

132
00:12:47,700 --> 00:12:48,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,</font>

133
00:12:48,910 --> 00:12:51,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the odds are high that
there will be traps or an ambush.</font>

134
00:12:54,040 --> 00:12:55,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen carefully...</font>

135
00:12:55,330 --> 00:12:57,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hereafter I want you to use your visual
and acoustic senses to the fullest!</font>

136
00:12:58,170 --> 00:13:01,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We need to locate those guys before
we get caught in an ambush!</font>

137
00:13:02,670 --> 00:13:05,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And if we come across
anything suspicious</font>

138
00:13:05,630 --> 00:13:08,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">don't just dodge them
interpret them!</font>

139
00:13:09,510 --> 00:13:10,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right!</font>

140
00:13:10,760 --> 00:13:11,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we find them,</font>

141
00:13:12,060 --> 00:13:14,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna use my new Jutsu
to beat them!</font>

142
00:13:15,350 --> 00:13:16,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto...</font>

143
00:13:16,900 --> 00:13:19,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Each time I see him
he's added a new Jutsu to his arsenal.</font>

144
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:23,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Just when I thought
I had caught up with him...</font>

145
00:13:27,990 --> 00:13:30,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! The enemy's smell is everywhere!</font>

146
00:13:30,490 --> 00:13:31,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody! Stop!</font>

147
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:36,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take a careful look above you.</font>

148
00:13:40,540 --> 00:13:41,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Paper Bombs...</font>

149
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And in five other places too!</font>

150
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:47,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The figuration is that of
a Perimeter Barrier.</font>

151
00:13:48,340 --> 00:13:49,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perimeter Barrier...?</font>

152
00:13:50,600 --> 00:13:52,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's one type of Booby Trap Ninjutsu!</font>

153
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:57,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perimeter-type traps have a time lag
and are activated</font>

154
00:13:57,190 --> 00:14:01,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when one enters the area that
has been marked by the enemy.</font>

155
00:14:02,690 --> 00:14:04,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's advanced Jutsu...</font>

156
00:14:04,650 --> 00:14:07,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was in one of the books that
my father made me read.</font>

157
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:13,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Our only choice
is to make a detour...</font>

158
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:42,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee... Do what you have to do!</font>

159
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee!</font>

160
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's too soon to be doing that!</font>

161
00:15:00,330 --> 00:15:01,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fifth Hokage-sama!</font>

162
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:04,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I already know that
you're a reckless guy.</font>

163
00:15:05,590 --> 00:15:08,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you've just had an operation.</font>

164
00:15:09,130 --> 00:15:10,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't need to be rushing
into things.</font>

165
00:15:20,020 --> 00:15:23,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to hurry up and
do even a little training.</font>

166
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:26,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I also want to... I want to...</font>

167
00:15:27,110 --> 00:15:30,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Building your strength isn't
the only form of training.</font>

168
00:15:31,110 --> 00:15:32,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you agree?</font>

169
00:15:34,620 --> 00:15:36,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is said that Ninja are those</font>

170
00:15:36,370 --> 00:15:39,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who can forebear and
endure any hardship.</font>

171
00:15:40,660 --> 00:15:41,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand how you feel but...</font>

172
00:15:42,670 --> 00:15:44,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means that this too
is one kind of training.</font>

173
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:48,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Training...</font>

174
00:15:49,670 --> 00:15:52,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What if you were to do something reckless
and you got worse?</font>

175
00:15:56,390 --> 00:15:58,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What's that?</font>

176
00:15:59,850 --> 00:16:02,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's medicine that I prepared.</font>

177
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:04,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, drink this and get better!</font>

178
00:16:08,820 --> 00:16:09,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

179
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:11,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come, let's go...</font>

180
00:16:11,570 --> 00:16:12,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, ma'am.</font>

181
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:20,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Nothing but traps!</font>

182
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:23,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, but the enemy seems
pressed for time.</font>

183
00:16:24,830 --> 00:16:26,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The traps have noticeable flaws.</font>

184
00:16:31,300 --> 00:16:34,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, Naruto!
There's wire at your feet!</font>

185
00:16:35,140 --> 00:16:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't trip on it!</font>

186
00:16:37,050 --> 00:16:38,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that already!</font>

187
00:16:39,890 --> 00:16:41,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait, Naruto!</font>

188
00:16:54,660 --> 00:16:56,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu...</font>

189
00:16:57,120 --> 00:17:00,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-Made it just in the nick of time.</font>

190
00:17:00,790 --> 00:17:03,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! I told you to be careful!</font>

191
00:17:06,790 --> 00:17:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... One of the wires is
readily visible because it reflects light.</font>

192
00:17:13,130 --> 00:17:16,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The other wire has been coated
with a matte green.</font>

193
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:20,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it's very difficult to see
with the naked eye.</font>

194
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:22,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a double trap, huh.</font>

195
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Despite the fact that
they're in a hurry,</font>

196
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that's certainly an elaborate trap.</font>

197
00:17:28,190 --> 00:17:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which means that...</font>

198
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That they're at rest.</font>

199
00:17:32,400 --> 00:17:35,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Perhaps they got injured
or that itself could be a trap...</font>

200
00:17:38,120 --> 00:17:39,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

201
00:17:48,420 --> 00:17:49,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Caught 'em!</font>

202
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:53,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! All right!
I'll drag Sasuke back without fail!</font>

203
00:17:53,340 --> 00:17:55,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Hate to tell you this</font>

204
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I'm gonna demonstrate
my new Jutsu right here!</font>

205
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:00,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me too!</font>

206
00:18:01,680 --> 00:18:02,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be so hasty.</font>

207
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As soon as preparations have been made
to implement my strategy...</font>

208
00:18:06,850 --> 00:18:08,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'll make direct contact
with the target!</font>

209
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:31,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! When we're in a hurry
having to take a damn break...</font>

210
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped.</font>

211
00:18:35,090 --> 00:18:38,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When one fights at the second state
one's body gets drained drastically.</font>

212
00:18:39,090 --> 00:18:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More than that,</font>

213
00:18:40,090 --> 00:18:43,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's an ordeal not to be able
to use one's body for a while...</font>

214
00:18:43,600 --> 00:18:46,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped with
two Jonin-class guys as the opponents.</font>

215
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:50,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we act in moderation
we'll be done in.</font>

216
00:18:56,610 --> 00:18:57,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba...</font>

217
00:18:57,820 --> 00:18:58,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that event,</font>

218
00:18:58,860 --> 00:19:01,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">don't mess up the timing
of the Smoke Bombs.</font>

219
00:19:01,820 --> 00:19:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got it!</font>

220
00:19:03,780 --> 00:19:04,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then...</font>

221
00:19:04,950 --> 00:19:06,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'll split up into two teams.</font>

222
00:19:06,830 --> 00:19:07,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Right!
— Okay!</font>

223
00:20:07,930 --> 00:20:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like they haven't noticed us yet.</font>

224
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:14,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Sasuke's not around.</font>

225
00:20:17,690 --> 00:20:18,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears that...</font>

226
00:20:19,230 --> 00:20:20,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's inside that "coffin."</font>

227
00:20:21,650 --> 00:20:22,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he dead?!</font>

228
00:20:23,990 --> 00:20:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That barrel is secured with Barriers.
I can't see through it.</font>

229
00:20:28,580 --> 00:20:31,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wouldn't think that the guys
who wanted Sasuke</font>

230
00:20:31,330 --> 00:20:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would kill him that easily.</font>

231
00:20:37,130 --> 00:20:38,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You might be right about that.</font>

