<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#ffffff"><b></b></font></font></font>

266
00:22:38,330 --> 00:22:40,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Gimme a break, Shikamaru!
You're not reliable in the least!</font>

267
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:42,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">And you still call yourself
a leader?!</font>

268
00:22:42,090 --> 00:22:43,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But this situation sure
is a problem.</font>

269
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:45,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Leave this kind of thing to me.
It'll be a cinch.</font>

270
00:22:45,920 --> 00:22:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— I sure hope it will be.
— What do you mean by that?!</font>

271
00:22:48,340 --> 00:22:49,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It's too much of a hassle to explain.</font>

272
00:22:49,970 --> 00:22:51,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">— Shut up, Akamaru!
— Shut up, Akamaru!</font>

273
00:22:51,220 --> 00:22:53,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">What was that?!
Give 'em some more Akamaru!</font>

274
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Well if things come to this
I'll use that special weapon Rasengan!</font>

275
00:22:58,560 --> 00:23:02,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
